    "detailed_description": "In Putty Putter, the objective is simple, get the ball in the hole. To achieve that, you control a putty-like creature that can expand and use its surroundings to form different shapes required to solve the various challenging golf putting green themed puzzles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839090/extras/ff9dcee6e79672cd171f3e82b37e8cee.poster.avif?t=1749156532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839090/extras/ff9dcee6e79672cd171f3e82b37e8cee.webm?t=1749156532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839090/extras/ff9dcee6e79672cd171f3e82b37e8cee.mp4?t=1749156532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Grid based movement<br></li><li>Unique mechanic of being able to expand in 4 directions to form specific shapes required to solve the puzzles<br></li><li>New mechanics introduced throughout the game, such as spikes that are hazardous to the player, unique blocks that can only be pushed when you are a certain size and blocks that remove chunks off the player to form new shapes<br></li><li>Different themed courses with non-linear paths through the levels<br></li><li>Unlimited undo allows you to experiment with different solutions without needing to restart the level from scratch if mistakes are made</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "In Putty Putter, the objective is simple, get the ball in the hole. To achieve that, you control a putty-like creature that can expand and use its surroundings to form different shapes required to solve the various challenging golf putting green themed puzzles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839090/extras/ff9dcee6e79672cd171f3e82b37e8cee.poster.avif?t=1749156532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839090/extras/ff9dcee6e79672cd171f3e82b37e8cee.webm?t=1749156532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839090/extras/ff9dcee6e79672cd171f3e82b37e8cee.mp4?t=1749156532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Grid based movement<br></li><li>Unique mechanic of being able to expand in 4 directions to form specific shapes required to solve the puzzles<br></li><li>New mechanics introduced throughout the game, such as spikes that are hazardous to the player, unique blocks that can only be pushed when you are a certain size and blocks that remove chunks off the player to form new shapes<br></li><li>Different themed courses with non-linear paths through the levels<br></li><li>Unlimited undo allows you to experiment with different solutions without needing to restart the level from scratch if mistakes are made</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A grid-based movement golf game where you control a putty-like creature with the unique ability to expand and form different shapes. Do you have what it takes to stretch your brain power to the limit and conquer all mind-bending puzzles on offer?",
